  "title": "Vertiv Introduces New Lithium-Ion UPS to Support Retail Point-of-Sale, Workstations, and Other Small Compute Applications in North America",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced the release of its Vertiv™ Liebert® Power-UPS Lithium uninterruptible power supply (UPS), designed to protect retail point-of-sale (POS) equipment, computers, workstations, wireless networks and routers, surveillance systems and other electronics. The Liebert® Power-UPS Lithium UPS system will be available in Q2 2023 in North America.",
